          "about": "{name} is one of the biggest animals on Earth, even bigger than elephants. It lives in the ocean but must come up to breathe air. {name} sings long songs underwater that other whales can hear.",
          "funFact": "Did you know? A blue {name} heart can be as big as a small car! Whales eat tiny creatures called krill or small fish. Baby whales drink rich milk from their mother.",
